Package: clamui-privileged-helper
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCHITECTURE
Depends: pkexec | policykit-1
Replaces: clamui (<= VERSION)
Maintainer: ClamUI Contributors <clamui@rooki.xyz>
Homepage: https://github.com/linx-systems/clamui
Description: Root-owned native pkexec helper and polkit policy for ClamUI
 Root-owned Rust helper (/usr/bin/clamui-apply-preferences) and the matching
 polkit policy that let ClamUI apply authorized host ClamAV configuration via
 pkexec.
 .
 This package coexists with clamui and owns only the privileged helper and
 policy. clamui depends on this exact version.
 .
 Replaces lets dpkg transfer ownership of the helper and policy from an older
 clamui package of at most the same version without forcing an uninstall.
